{"title": "Digital Deluxe Upgrade", "pageid": 6858, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Digital_Deluxe_Upgrade", "categories": ["Game content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp/500px-Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp/750px-Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp/1000px-Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp/500px-Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"279\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Deluxe_Edition_Promo.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Promotional image for the Deluxe Edition.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Digital Deluxe Upgrade</b> is a DLC item that unlocks a selection of content inside and outside the game.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Digital_Content\">Digital Content</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Digital Artbook</li>\n<li>Digital Character Sheets</li>\n<li>Digital <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3_-_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3 - Original Soundtrack\">Original Soundtrack (OST)</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"In-game_Content\">In-game Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Abilities_and_Effects\">Abilities and Effects</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Exclusive <a href=\"/wiki/Die_designs\" title=\"Die designs\">die design</a> which varies depending on platform</li>\n<li>Adds three songs to the <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Perform (disambiguation)\">Perform</a> action:\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Of_Divinity_and_Sin%27\" title=\"Perform 'Of Divinity and Sin'\">Of Divinity and Sin</a></i></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27Sing_for_Me%27\" title=\"Perform 'Sing for Me'\">Sing for Me</a></i></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Queen%27s_High_Seas%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Queen's High Seas'\">The Queen's High Seas</a></i></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Delivered_Items\">Delivered Items</span></h3>\n<p>These items appear in the <a href=\"/wiki/Traveller%27s_Chest\" title=\"Traveller's Chest\">Traveller's Chest</a> at your <a href=\"/wiki/Campsite\" title=\"Campsite\">Campsite</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bewildering_Adventurer%27s_Pack\" title=\"Bewildering Adventurer's Pack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Backpack_B_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Backpack_B_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Backpack_B_Unfaded_Icon.webp/45px-Backpack_B_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Backpack_B_Unfaded_Icon.webp/60px-Backpack_B_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Backpack_B_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Backpack_B_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Backpack_B_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bewildering_Adventurer%27s_Pack\" title=\"Bewildering Adventurer's Pack\">Bewildering Adventurer's Pack</a></span> containing:\n<ul><li>One <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Hill Giant Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/ELX_Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Hill_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Hill Giant Strength\">Elixir of Hill Giant Strength</a>.</li>\n<li>One potion each of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Animal_Speaking\" title=\"Potion of Animal Speaking\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/POT_Potion_of_Animal_Speaking_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Animal_Speaking\" title=\"Potion of Animal Speaking\">Animal Speaking</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Feather_Fall\" title=\"Potion of Feather Fall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Feather_Fall\" title=\"Potion of Feather Fall\">Feather Fall</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Flying\" title=\"Potion of Flying\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/POT_Potion_of_Flying_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Flying_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/POT_Potion_of_Flying_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Flying_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/POT_Potion_of_Flying_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Flying_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/POT_Potion_of_Flying_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Flying_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/POT_Potion_of_Flying_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Flying\" title=\"Potion of Flying\">Flying</a>, and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Mind_Reading\" title=\"Potion of Mind Reading\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Mind_Reading\" title=\"Potion of Mind Reading\">Mind Reading</a>.</li>\n<li>Various camp supply items totaling 71 <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter\" title=\"Mask of the Shapeshifter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_the_Shapeshifter\" title=\"Mask of the Shapeshifter\">Mask of the Shapeshifter</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Peculiar_Clothing_Chest\" title=\"Peculiar Clothing Chest\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/45px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/60px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Peculiar_Clothing_Chest\" title=\"Peculiar Clothing Chest\">Peculiar Clothing Chest</a></span> containing:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast\" title=\"Bicorne of the Sea Beast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bicorne_of_the_Sea_Beast\" title=\"Bicorne of the Sea Beast\">Bicorne of the Sea Beast</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cape_of_the_Red_Prince\" title=\"Cape of the Red Prince\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Cape_of_the_Red_Prince_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cape_of_the_Red_Prince_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Cape_of_the_Red_Prince_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cape_of_the_Red_Prince_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Cape_of_the_Red_Prince_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Cape_of_the_Red_Prince_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Cape_of_the_Red_Prince_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cape_of_the_Red_Prince_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Cape_of_the_Red_Prince_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cape_of_the_Red_Prince\" title=\"Cape of the Red Prince\">Cape of the Red Prince</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lute_of_the_Merryweather_Bard\" title=\"Lute of the Merryweather Bard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Instrument_Lohses_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Lute_of_the_Merryweather_Bard\" title=\"Lute of the Merryweather Bard\">Lute of the Merryweather Bard</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue\" title=\"Needle of the Outlaw Rogue\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Needle_of_the_Outlaw_Rogue\" title=\"Needle of the Outlaw Rogue\">Needle of the Outlaw Rogue</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Paintings_from_Rivellon\">Paintings from Rivellon</span></h3>\n<p>These new paintings are scattered throughout the world to be found by the player.\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Portrait_of_Fane\" title=\"Portrait of Fane\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png/30px-Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png/45px-Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png/60px-Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png/30px-Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Portrait_of_Fane\" title=\"Portrait of Fane\">Portrait of Fane</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3